{"id":"orgullo","lemma":"orgullo","pos":"noun","rank":1639,"glosses":["pride (arrogance, haughtiness)","pride (sense of self-worth)","pride (something of which one is proud)"],"ipa":"/oɾˈɡuʝo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"orgullos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-orgullo.wav","examples":[{"text":"La derrota hirió su orgullo.","en":"Losing injured their pride.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639868"},{"text":"Le costaba ocultar su orgullo por su éxito.","en":"It was difficult for him to hide his pride in his success.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693023"},{"text":"Él se tragó su orgullo.","en":"He swallowed his pride."},{"text":"Eres mi orgullo y alegría.","en":"You are my pride and joy."},{"text":"Tenés que tragarte tu orgullo.","en":"You need to swallow your pride."}]}